Package: hermuse-agent
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Yellow Stick <contact@yellow-stick.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://yellow-stick.com
Description: personal agent that works with Hermes Agent
 Hermuse Agent by Yellow Stick: ask in plain words and the agent gets to
 work in your calendar, your apps and on the web, checking with you before
 anything that matters.
 .
 On first launch the app prepares the system keyring, a local Hermes Agent
 with the Hermuse plugin, the subscription bridge and the agent's computer.
 System packages are installed after one administrator approval.